    "collapsible-content": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible-row-3": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "List of ingredients",
            "icon": "leaf",
            "row_content": "<p>Maltodextrin, Sodium Bicarbonate, Xylitol, Citric Acid, Sodium Lauryl Sulfate, Sodium Lauroyl Glutamate, Sugar Sodium Concentrate, Microcrystalline Cellulose, Sodium Hydride, Hydrated Silica, Menthol, Steviosides, Niacinamide, Sodium Benzoate, Lactobacilli, Water.<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible-row-1": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What's in the box?",
            "icon": "box",
            "row_content": "<p>Each order of Toothpaste Tablets consists of:<\/p><ul><li>Flavoured Tablets 30x <\/li><li>Portable Tin Jar<\/li><li>Manual<\/li><li>Toothpaste Tablet Box<\/li><\/ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible-row-0": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How to use?",
            "icon": "lightning_bolt",
            "row_content": "<p>Quick and easy (2-3 minutes)<\/p><p><strong>1. Pop a Tablet:<\/strong> Take one toothpaste tablet and place it in your mouth.<\/p><p><strong>2. Chew the Tablet:<\/strong> Gently chew the tablet to break it down into a paste. It will start to foam up, just like regular toothpaste.<\/p><p><strong>3. Brush:<\/strong> Use your wet toothbrush to brush your teeth as usual, ensuring you reach all surfaces.<\/p><p><strong>4. Rinse:<\/strong> Spit out the foam and rinse your mouth with water.<\/p><p><strong>5. Smile:<\/strong> Enjoy the clean, fresh feeling with your new, eco-friendly oral care routine!<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "792a2454-8dbe-40ac-ae87-a745eb01fb9b": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What are the key ingredients?",
            "icon": "clipboard",
            "row_content": "<p><strong>Hydroxyapatite:<\/strong> A mineral that helps support the surface strength of enamel — a gentle alternative to fluoride.<br\/><br\/><strong>Xylitol:<\/strong> A natural sweetener that helps maintain oral freshness and reduce the stickiness of unwanted buildup.<br\/><br\/><strong>Sodium Bicarbonate:<\/strong> A mild abrasive that helps polish surface stains and balance pH levels in the mouth.<br\/><br\/><strong>Sodium Lauryl Sulfate (SLS):<\/strong> A foaming agent that helps spread the formula evenly across your teeth.<br\/><br\/><strong>Hydrated Silica:<\/strong> A gentle polishing agent that helps lift debris and enhance surface smoothness.<br\/><strong><br\/>Menthol:<\/strong> Delivers a cool, minty taste and leaves your mouth feeling refreshed.<br\/><br\/>These ingredients work together to help clean, refresh, and support a healthy-looking smile — without the mess.<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "22779142-8db6-4dbf-93b6-ac3fd9d5b799": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Warnings & Caution",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>All products sold on our website are carefully reviewed and tested for quality and safety.<br\/><br\/><strong>1. Choking Hazard:<\/strong> Keep out of reach of children under 6 years old. Toothpaste tablets may pose a choking risk if swallowed whole.<br\/><strong><br\/>2. Use as Directed:<\/strong> Use only one tablet per brushing session. Excessive use may cause oral discomfort or irritation.<br\/><br\/><strong>3. Allergic Reactions:<\/strong> If you experience swelling, rash, or difficulty breathing, stop use immediately and seek advice from a healthcare professional.<br\/><br\/><strong>4. Avoid Swallowing:<\/strong> Do not swallow the paste after brushing. Spit out any residue and rinse your mouth thoroughly with water.<br\/><br\/><strong>5. Dental Conditions:<\/strong> If you have sensitive teeth, gum concerns, or ongoing dental issues, speak to your dentist before use.<br\/><br\/><strong>6. Storage:<\/strong> Store in a cool, dry place away from sunlight and moisture to maintain freshness and product quality.<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
